== 4 the limits, each crossed and each controlled ==
a part of 5 bytes against a 4 byte limit:
   refused: a multipart part exceeds the 4-byte limit
ok an oversized part is refused
ok and the refusal names the limit it crossed
   the control, at exactly 5: fields=0 | file f "n.txt" text/plain form=5 stored=5
